     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Industry-aligned fintech training programs designed and delivered 
Indicator: By 2026, eight industry-aligned fintech training programs designed and delivered within international standards 
Progress/Status: A total of five FinTech programs have been designed and developed, with four additional programs currently under development. These programs encompass a range of subjects, including multiple courses focused on career development and one specifically addressing soft skills and language skills. The developed courses include Fintech Foundations, Finance behind Fintech, Technology for FinTech, AI &amp; ML in Fintech, and Software Bootcamp for Fintech Applications. Additional specialized offerings include Treasury and Risk Management -Part 1 and 2, Fintech Workplace Environment &amp; Professional Communication, and Financial Intermediation and Technology for the Informal Sector. Several new courses are under development, with a particular emphasis on entrepreneurship and skill-building for women. 
Data Source: Quarterly progress reports, MIS reports and annual reports 
